# Refuse to push a merge conflict block, an unparseable JSON file, a manifest
# that disagrees with schema/, or a manifest/package version mismatch.
#
# Scope is the commits actually being pushed (git feeds the ref pairs on stdin),
# so this blocks NEW poison without wedging on defects that already sit on the
# branch. The whole-tree gate is `npm run check:integrity`, which `npm run
# deploy` runs before it commits.
node scripts/check-release-integrity.mjs --pre-push
